Roles can define **access levels** (e.g., Admin > Manager > Employee).

| Role        | Permissions |
|-------------|------------|
| Admin       | Full access |
| Manager     | Manage users, view reports |
| Employee    | Limited access to own data |

### **✅ Example: Check Role in Code**
```csharp
if (User.IsInRole("Manager"))
{
